  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The arithmetic mean of numbers a, $\\mathrm{b}, \\mathrm{c}, \\mathrm{d}, \\mathrm{e}$ is $\\mathrm{M}$. What is the value of $(a-M)+(b-M)+(c-M)+$ $(\\mathrm{d}-\\mathrm{M})+(\\mathrm{e}-\\mathrm{M}) ?$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "wsGpL",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{M}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KWXur",
      "text": "$a+b+c+d+e$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IzO5A",
      "text": "0",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ml11i",
      "text": "$5 \\mathrm{M}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $\\mathrm{M}=\\frac{\\mathrm{a}+\\mathrm{b}+\\mathrm{c}+\\mathrm{d}+\\mathrm{e}}{5}$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow a+b+c+d+e=5 M$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow a+b+c+d+e-5 m=0$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow(a-M)+(b-M)+(c-M)+(d-M) \\\\\r\n\r\n+(e-M)=0\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\nHence, required value $=0$",
    "image": null
  },
